<title>JAPAN: Nikko Sec files 100 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nikko Sec files 100 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Securities Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 100 billion yen worth of corporate bonds, effective for two years from January 17.</p>
</text>
